  "body": "The scale of a standalone home, with the ease and freedom of apartment living.\r\n\r\nWhat if you could enjoy all the space and comfort of a substantial home, without the ongoing upkeep of a standalone property?\r\n\r\nOffering an impressive 154m² of easy-care living, this spacious three-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment delivers a lifestyle that is hard to beat. \r\n\r\nWhether you're ready to downsize without compromising on space, seeking a secure lock-and-leave lifestyle, or simply wanting more time for family and the things you love, this could be exactly what you've been waiting for.\r\n\r\nThe living areas open effortlessly to a covered garden patio, with gated access to beautifully landscaped grounds - an inviting spot for your morning coffee, relaxed entertaining or simply enjoying the outdoors.\r\n\r\nA separate study provides the perfect work-from-home space, while three generous bedrooms, two bathrooms and two secure car parks offer the flexibility and practicality modern living demands.\r\n\r\nThere's also the added enjoyment of a heated swimming pool, pet-friendly surroundings and professionally managed grounds, allowing you to enjoy the benefits without the maintenance.\r\n\r\nAnd the location? Takapuna's vibrant cafés, restaurants, shopping, public transport and beautiful beach are all close at hand.\r\n\r\nMore time for living, less time looking after a home.\r\n\r\nWhether you're simplifying, travelling more, juggling a busy family life or simply ready for a change, this is an opportunity to embrace a more convenient way of living in one of the North Shore's most sought-after locations.\r\n\r\nCome and discover the possibilities.",
